      "html" : "<\/div><\/div><div style=\"margin-bottom=10pt\">&#160;<\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170793\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170793\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFor SI: 1 inch = 25.4 mm.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170794\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170794\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ta.&#160;&#160;&#160;This table does not apply to studs or joists spaced more than 16 inches o.c.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170795\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170795\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tb.&#160;&#160;&#160;All studs shall be nominal 2 &#215; 4 and all joists shall have a nominal thickness of not less than 2 inches.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170796\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170796\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"Small\"><div style=\"margin-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tc.&#160;&#160;&#160;Allowable spans for joists shall be determined in accordance with Sections 2308.4.2.1, 2308.7.1 and 2308.7.2.<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-170797\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-170797\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><a name=\"JD_BCTable722.6.2(3)\" id=\"JD_BCTable722.6.2(3)\" title=\"BC Table 722.6.2(3)\"><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Table 722.6.2(3)<br><\/br>Membrane <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: norma